---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Wellbeing Hub
description: "Manchester LMC Wellbeing Hub — mental health support, peer networks, crisis lines, free apps, and financial assistance for GPs."
mainClass: page-wellbeing
showContactStrip: true
showDisclaimer: true
permalink: /support/wellbeing/
---

  <!-- ── Page Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Page header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        {% set breadcrumbs = [{url: "/support/", label: "Support"}, {label: "Wellbeing Hub"}] %}
        {% include "partials/breadcrumb.njk" %}
        <h1>Wellbeing Hub</h1>
        <p>We care about the people who care for Manchester.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Intro ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="wellbeing-intro-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 820px;">
        <h2 id="wellbeing-intro-heading" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">You give everything to your patients. We want to help you look after yourself.</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--colour-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">
          GP burnout is not a personal failing — it is a system-wide challenge. Manchester's GPs and primary care staff are working under unprecedented pressure: rising demand, workforce shortages, complex patients, and relentless administrative burden. It takes a toll.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">
          Manchester LMC is committed to supporting the mental health and wellbeing of every GP and practice staff member across our patch. This hub brings together the best available resources — NHS services, peer support, crisis lines, digital tools, and financial assistance — all in one place.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); line-height: 1.8;">
          If you are struggling right now, please reach out. You do not have to manage alone, and everything you share with us remains confidential.
        </p>

        <!-- Crisis alert -->
        <div class="alert" role="alert" style="margin-top: var(--space-7); background-color: #fff3e0; border-color: var(--colour-accent); color: #bf360c; display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); align-items: flex-start;">
          <span style="flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;">{% icon "alert-triangle", 22 %}</span>
          <div>
            <strong>If you are in crisis right now, please call Samaritans on <a href="tel:116123" style="color: inherit; font-weight: 700;">116 123</a></strong> (free, 24/7) or the Manchester Mental Health Crisis Line on <a href="tel:08009530285" style="color: inherit; font-weight: 700;">0800 953 0285</a>.
            If there is an immediate risk to life, call <strong>999</strong>.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Jump nav -->
        <nav aria-label="Page sections" style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">
          <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--colour-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Jump to section:</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3);">
            <a href="#mental-health" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm">Mental Health Support</a>
            <a href="#peer-support" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm">Peer Support &amp; Mentoring</a>
            <a href="#crisis" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm">Crisis Support</a>
            <a href="#apps" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm">Free Apps</a>
            <a href="#financial" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm">Financial Assistance</a>
          </div>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 1: Mental Health Support ───────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section--alt" id="mental-health" aria-labelledby="mental-health-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--colour-white);" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "heart", 20 %}
          </div>
          <h2 id="mental-health-heading" style="margin: 0;">Mental Health Support</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Free, confidential services specifically for doctors and healthcare professionals.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-5);">

        <!-- NHS Practitioner Health -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-nph-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "activity", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-nph-title">NHS Practitioner Health</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">NHS Service — Free for doctors</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">A free, confidential NHS primary care service for doctors and dentists with mental illness or addiction problems. Offers therapy, psychiatry, and clinical support without it affecting your GMC registration by default.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.practitionerhealth.nhs.uk" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit NHS Practitioner Health website (opens in new tab)">
              Visit Website
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- BMA Counselling -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-bma-counsel-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "message-square", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-bma-counsel-title">BMA 24/7 Counselling</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">BMA — Free &amp; Confidential</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">The BMA's counselling and peer support service is free for all doctors, medical students, and their immediate families. Trained counsellors are available around the clock — no appointment needed.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="tel:03301231245" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" aria-label="Call BMA 24/7 counselling on 0330 123 1245">
              {% icon "phone", 12 %}
              0330 123 1245
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.bma.org.uk/advice-and-support/your-wellbeing" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit BMA wellbeing page (opens in new tab)">More info</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Samaritans -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-samaritans-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "heart", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-samaritans-title">Samaritans</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Listening support — Free, 24/7</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">Samaritans provide confidential listening support to anyone in emotional distress or struggling to cope — including doctors. No judgement, no advice, just someone there to listen at any time of day or night.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="tel:116123" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" aria-label="Call Samaritans on 116 123 (free)">
              {% icon "phone", 12 %}
              116 123
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.samaritans.org" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit Samaritans website (opens in new tab)">More info</a>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div><!-- /grid-3 -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 2: Peer Support & Mentoring ─────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="peer-support" aria-labelledby="peer-support-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--colour-white);" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "users", 20 %}
          </div>
          <h2 id="peer-support-heading" style="margin: 0;">Peer Support &amp; Mentoring</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Connect with fellow doctors who understand the pressures of general practice.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-5);">

        <!-- GP Support -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-gps-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "users", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-gps-title">GP Support (GP-S)</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Peer support for GPs</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">GP-S is a peer support scheme run by GPs for GPs. Trained GP supporters offer one-to-one phone support on a voluntary basis. A confidential conversation with someone who truly understands the job.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.gp-s.org.uk" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit GP-S website (opens in new tab)">
              Visit GP-S
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- BMA Peer Support Groups -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-bma-peer-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "globe", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-bma-peer-title">BMA Peer Support Groups</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">BMA — Nationwide</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">The BMA runs structured peer support groups for doctors across the country, including specialty-specific groups. Groups meet regularly (usually online) to share experiences and strategies for managing the demands of medical practice.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.bma.org.uk/advice-and-support/your-wellbeing/peer-support" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit BMA peer support groups page (opens in new tab)">
              Find a Group
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- NHS Leadership Academy Mentoring -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-nhsla-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "activity", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-nhsla-title">NHS Leadership Academy Mentoring</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">NHS — Mentoring scheme</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">The NHS Leadership Academy runs a national mentoring scheme connecting healthcare professionals with experienced mentors. Structured mentoring conversations support career development, resilience, and leadership in primary care.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.leadershipacademy.nhs.uk/programmes/mentoring/" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit NHS Leadership Academy mentoring programme (opens in new tab)">
              Apply for Mentoring
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div><!-- /grid-3 -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 3: Crisis Support ──────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section--alt" id="crisis" aria-labelledby="crisis-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: #c62828; border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--colour-white);" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "alert-triangle", 20 %}
          </div>
          <h2 id="crisis-heading" style="margin: 0;">Crisis Support</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Immediate help available around the clock. You do not have to face a crisis alone.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-5);">

        <!-- Manchester Mental Health Crisis Line -->
        <article class="resource-card" style="border-color: #ef9a9a;" aria-labelledby="res-mcr-crisis-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="background-color: #ffebee; color: #c62828;" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "phone", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-mcr-crisis-title">Manchester Mental Health Crisis Line</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Local — Free, 24/7</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">Manchester's dedicated mental health crisis line connects you to a trained crisis worker any time of day or night. Available to anyone in Manchester experiencing a mental health crisis, including healthcare workers.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="tel:08009530285" class="btn btn--sm" style="background-color: #c62828; color: white; border: none;" aria-label="Call Manchester Mental Health Crisis Line on 0800 953 0285 (free)">
              {% icon "phone", 12 %}
              0800 953 0285
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- National Suicide Prevention Helpline UK -->
        <article class="resource-card" style="border-color: #ef9a9a;" aria-labelledby="res-nsphuk-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="background-color: #ffebee; color: #c62828;" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "phone", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-nsphuk-title">National Suicide Prevention Helpline UK</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Suicide prevention — Free, all adults</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">The National Suicide Prevention Helpline UK offers a safe, non-judgmental space for anyone struggling with suicidal thoughts or distress. Trained volunteers provide confidential support — available every evening from 6pm to midnight.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="tel:08006895652" class="btn btn--sm" style="background-color: #c62828; color: white; border: none;" aria-label="Call National Suicide Prevention Helpline UK on 0800 689 5652 (free)">
              {% icon "phone", 12 %}
              0800 689 5652
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.spuk.org.uk" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit National Suicide Prevention Helpline UK website (opens in new tab)">More info</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Shout 85258 -->
        <article class="resource-card" style="border-color: #ef9a9a;" aria-labelledby="res-shout-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="background-color: #ffebee; color: #c62828;" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "message-square", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-shout-title">Shout Text Service</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Text support — Free, 24/7</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">If you're struggling but don't feel able to talk, text SHOUT to 85258. Shout's trained crisis volunteers offer confidential text-based support for anyone in crisis — available any time, entirely free.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <div class="btn btn--sm" style="background-color: #c62828; color: white; border: none; cursor: default;" aria-label="Text SHOUT to 85258">
              {% icon "message-square", 12 %}
              Text SHOUT to 85258
            </div>
            <a href="https://giveusashout.org" class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit Shout website (opens in new tab)">More info</a>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div><!-- /grid-3 -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 4: Free Apps & Digital Tools ────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="apps" aria-labelledby="apps-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--colour-white);" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "smartphone", 20 %}
          </div>
          <h2 id="apps-heading" style="margin: 0;">Free Apps &amp; Digital Tools</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Evidence-based digital wellbeing tools — free or subsidised for NHS staff.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-5);">

        <!-- SilverCloud -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-silvercloud-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "cloud", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-silvercloud-title">SilverCloud</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Online CBT — Free via NHS</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">SilverCloud offers clinically validated, structured online cognitive behavioural therapy (CBT) programmes for anxiety, depression, stress, and sleep difficulties. Available free to NHS staff — no GP referral required, available 24/7.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.silvercloudhealth.com/uk" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit SilverCloud website (opens in new tab)">
              Access SilverCloud
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Headspace -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-headspace-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "disc", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-headspace-title">Headspace</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Mindfulness &amp; meditation — Free for NHS</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">Headspace offers guided meditation, mindfulness, and sleep content to support mental health and resilience. The full app is available free for all NHS staff — register with your NHS email address to access the complete library.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.headspace.com/nhs" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Access Headspace for NHS (opens in new tab)">
              Get Free Access
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Unmind -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-unmind-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "activity", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-unmind-title">Unmind</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Wellbeing platform — NHS staff</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">Unmind is a workplace mental health platform offering science-based tools to measure and improve wellbeing. Programmes cover topics including stress, anxiety, sleep, and resilience — designed specifically for busy professionals.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://unmind.com/nhs" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Access Unmind for NHS staff (opens in new tab)">
              Access Unmind
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div><!-- /grid-3 -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Section 5: Financial Assistance ────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section--alt" id="financial" aria-labelledby="financial-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--colour-white);" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "dollar-sign", 20 %}
          </div>
          <h2 id="financial-heading" style="margin: 0;">Financial Assistance</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Financial difficulty can happen to anyone. There is help available and no stigma in asking.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-6);">

        <!-- Cameron Fund -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-cameron-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "dollar-sign", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-cameron-title">Cameron Fund</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">Financial assistance — Grants &amp; loans</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">The Cameron Fund has provided financial assistance to GPs and their families since 1970. The Fund offers grants and interest-free loans to registered GPs in financial difficulty due to illness, mental health problems, family breakdown, or other hardship. The application process is means-tested and completely confidential — there is no contact with employers or the GMC.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.cameronfund.org.uk" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit Cameron Fund website (opens in new tab)">
              Visit Cameron Fund
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- BMA Benevolent Fund -->
        <article class="resource-card" aria-labelledby="res-bma-ben-title">
          <div class="resource-card-header">
            <div class="resource-card-logo" style="color: var(--colour-primary);" aria-hidden="true">
              {% icon "monitor", 28 %}
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="resource-card-title" id="res-bma-ben-title">BMA Benevolent Fund</h3>
              <p class="resource-card-type">BMA — Financial support</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="resource-card-desc">The BMA Benevolent Fund provides financial assistance and welfare support to BMA members and their dependants who are facing hardship. This can include help with living costs, disability adaptations, or other one-off financial pressures. Applications are assessed with compassion and discretion.</p>
          <div class="resource-card-actions">
            <a href="https://www.bma.org.uk/advice-and-support/your-wellbeing/financial-and-legal-support" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit BMA financial support page (opens in new tab)">
              Visit BMA Fund
              {% icon "external-link", 12 %}
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div><!-- /grid-2 -->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Talk to us CTA ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="wellbeing-cta-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
        <h2 id="wellbeing-cta-heading" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-5);">Not sure where to turn?</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: var(--space-7);">
          If you're not sure which resource is right for you, or just want to talk something through, call Manchester LMC. Everything you tell us stays with us.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="tel:01612230032" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">
            {% icon "phone", 18 %}
            Call 0161 223 0032
          </a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--outline btn--lg">Send a message</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
